# `venv/` as well as `.venv/`: scripts/run_tests.sh prunes BOTH from the bytecode sweep and docs/CLEAN_CLONE.md
# tells the reader, in the Steps that create one, that both are "pruned ... and ignored by git". Only `.venv/`
# was here, so a reader who followed the Steps and used `venv` got an untracked interpreter tree in git status.
# Pinned by test_every_directory_pruned_from_the_bytecode_sweep_is_git_ignored.
